  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">AgriFI Country Window for Sri Lanka</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The objectives of EDFI-AgriFI (Global Facility) are to increase the value-added, production and incomes of smallholder farmers in low and lower-middle income countries by investing in private sector enterprises that involve smallholder farmers, and/or contribute to the food security of the hosting country. Specifically, for the EDFI AgriFI Country Window for Sri Lanka, these objectives can be further elaborated as per the below structure: &#xbf;&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
